Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Turn mobile data on and off from its tile without
 asking

A tap on the mobile data tile opened the internet dialog, and its toggle
asked to confirm every time mobile data was turned on. Make both turn
mobile data on or off right away, like the old cellular tile did. The
internet dialog is still one tap away in the Wi-Fi tile.

Change-Id: I3425bb8393b9d28b7c06f8c58b79e7d24be7c3d6
